		{
			description: [
				"By default &6M&r opens the map, and &6T&r teleports you to the spot your cursor is pointing at; clicking the globe icon in the bottom left switches dimensions"
				""
				"You can claim and force-load chunks in the top left of the interface (claimed chunks are blast-proof). On a server, setting &6Force Load Mode&r in FTB Chunks' server settings (the purple gear) to &balways&r keeps force-loaded chunks loaded even when nobody is online"
				""
				"Hold &6~&r to enable chain mining"
				""
				"The third button from the top in the top right of the quest screen shows the keyboard shortcuts for the quest interface"
				""
				"Enter /sethome \"name\" to set a teleport point, and /home \"the same name\" to teleport to that point"
				""
				"Save backups can be found in the backup folder in the game's root directory; enter /backup start to make a backup right away"
				""
				"Flight inertia is disabled by default, and can be changed in gtlcore's config file"
				""
				"If you see a GregTech version mismatch while playing online, make sure the server's and the client's config files match"
				""
				"More tips can be found in the &dTips and Tricks chapter group&r"
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "ftbquests:book"
			id: "4F864738509B6DCA"
			rewards: [{
				id: "723CCD5BBA07EEDA"
