		{
			description: [
				"This is bad news, you have arrived in a fragment world,"
				"this world is not complete, the world has broken into fragments,"
				"but I have left some good things for you, and they can help you continue your journey."
				"Keep them safe, &l&d&othey are all necessary!!!&r&r&r"
				""
				"Necessary tips:"
				"What is this! Skyblock Mode!"
				"Only if you chose &bSkyblock&r when creating the world"
				"can this quest be completed"
				"In the game menu, click &bMods&r,"
				"search for &bgtlcore&r, click &bConfig&r,"
				"change the &bSkyblock Mode&r config from &bfalse&r to &btrue&r"
				"After completing the steps above, &6restart the game&r; config changes do not support hot reloading"
				"That is the only way to really enter Skyblock mode; if you want to try the normal mode, just switch the mode back and create a new save"
				"See the next page for the Skyblock server setup process"
				""
				"{image:ftbquests:textures/picture/002.png width:320 height:200 align:center}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If you want to run a Skyblock server"
				"You need to change"
				""
				"in config/gtlcore.yaml"
				"set enableSkyBlokeMode to true"
				""
				"in server.properties"
				"set level-type to skyblockbuilder\\:skyblock"
				""
				"It is also recommended that you check the Skyblock Builder wiki"
				"wiki.chaotictrials.de/docs/wiki/skyblock-builder/"
				"to learn the relevant commands"
			]
			icon: "gtlcore:world_fragments_overworld"
			id: "0F4AFDE98CEA87B1"
			min_width: 350
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "0AFB0CC841A156B2"
				item: "gtlcore:world_fragments_overworld"
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "61677438ACE10819"
				item: "gtlcore:mining_crystal"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Skyblock Mode"
			x: -6.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
