		{
			description: [
				"The Performance Monitor can track the lag caused by all your machines"
				""
				"You can enter /forge tps to check the game's lag; it is best to keep TPS at 20"
				""
				"The following things may be causes of lag:"
				""
				"Building everything in one small space. This does not affect TPS, but it will lower FPS."
				""
				"Heavy use of Import and Export Buses in the network. ME Interfaces are recommended."
				""
				"Submitting orders that dispatch a small amount of items many times. It is recommended to reduce the CPU parallel count and increase the pattern multiplier at the same time."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: {
