		{
			dependencies: [
				"1A124E85453923DF"
				"40C39645B1DE2488"
			]
			description: [
				"On top of the Advanced Terminal, it supports &breplacing&r coils, Space Elevator Power Modules, Component Assembly Line Casings and Stellar Thermal Containers (click the \"Tier Blocks\" text to open the tier block selection screen)"
				""
				"It also supports &bmirror placement&r of multiblocks; No Hatch Mode stays active as well, and it can even place fluids (recognising fluid buckets you are carrying, the Infinity Bucket, and fluids in the ME Network)"
				""
				"It also supports &bbinding to AE&r, pulling materials straight from the ME Network to build multiblocks (sneak-right-click any component in the ME Network to bind)"
				""
				"It also supports &done-click disassembly&r of multiblocks (with AE Mode on, materials go straight back into the ME Network; with it off, it is best to carry containers such as backpacks; only AE Mode can recover fluids)"
			]
			id: "3F8DDC1B589F52AC"
